#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:1
msgid "Page Editor"
msgstr "ページエディター"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:3
msgid ""
"In the page editor, you can manage Flexbar devices, preview and edit pages. "
"You can use the mouse wheel to zoom and drag the virtual Flexbar."
msgstr ""
"ページエディターでは Flexbar を管理し、ページのプレビューと編集ができます。マウスホイールでズームし、"
"Virtual Flexbar をドラッグして操作できます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:5
msgid ""
"![1742261812783](image/getting_started/1742261812783.png) Feature "
"descriptions:"
msgstr "![1742261812783](image/getting_started/1742261812783.png) 機能の説明:"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:5
msgid "1742261812783"
msgstr "1742261812783"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:7
msgid "Fit to screen: Click to reset Flexbar's zoom level and position"
msgstr "画面に合わせる: Flexbar のズームと表示位置をリセットします。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:8
msgid ""
"Tree view: Click to browse all subpages and keys in a tree structure for "
"quick navigation between multiple subpages"
msgstr "ツリービュー: ページとキーを階層表示し、サブページ間を素早く移動できます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:9
msgid "Save your changes"
msgstr "変更を保存"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:10
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "元に戻す"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:11
msgid "Redo"
msgstr "やり直し"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:12
msgid ""
"Key temporary storage: You can temporarily store keys here for later use"
msgstr "キーの一時置き場: あとで使うキーをここに退避できます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:13
msgid "Device overview: Select devices to upload here"
msgstr "デバイス一覧: アップロード先の Flexbar を選びます"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:14
msgid "Upload configuration to device"
msgstr "設定をデバイスへアップロード"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:15
msgid ""
"Page scroll: When elements exceed page width, use the scroll buttons on both"
" sides to browse the interface"
msgstr "ページの横スクロール: 幅が足りないときは左右のボタンで表示範囲を移動します。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:16
msgid ""
"Drawer button: Click to open the drawer. Keys in the drawer won't change "
"with the main page and can be used for frequently used keys"
msgstr "ドロワー: 開くとメインページとは独立した領域にキーを置けます（常用キー向け）"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:17
msgid ""
"Preview interface: Drag to reorder keys or drag new keys from the key "
"library"
msgstr "プレビュー領域: キーをドラッグして並べ替え、Key Library から新しいキーを追加"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:18
msgid ""
"Storage status indicator: Your configuration is saved to Flexbar, showing "
"storage space usage. Keys don't use much storage, but GIFs do"
msgstr ""
"ストレージ表示: Flexbar 上の保存容量の使用状況です。キー自体は軽量ですが、GIF は容量を使います"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:20
msgid "Key Submenu"
msgstr "キーのサブメニュー"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:22
msgid "Right-click on a key to open the menu."
msgstr "キーを右クリックしてメニューを開きます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:24
msgid "![1742262258711](image/getting_started/1742262258711.png)"
msgstr "![1742262258711](image/getting_started/1742262258711.png)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:24
msgid "1742262258711"
msgstr "1742262258711"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:26
#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:42
msgid "Functions in order:"
msgstr "機能の順序:"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:28
msgid "Copy current key"
msgstr "現在のキーをコピーする"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:29
msgid "Create a duplicate of current key on current page"
msgstr "現在のページに現在のキーの複製を作成します"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:30
msgid "Cut current key"
msgstr "現在のキーをカットする"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:31
msgid "Copy current key's appearance"
msgstr "現在のキーの外観をコピーします"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:32
msgid "Paste copied appearance to current key"
msgstr "コピーした外観を現在のキーに貼り付けます"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:33
msgid "Delete current key"
msgstr "現在のキーを削除します"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:34
msgid "Save current key as image (not applicable to some keys)"
msgstr "現在のキーを画像として保存 (一部のキーには適用されません)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:36
msgid "Page Submenu"
msgstr "ページのサブメニュー"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:38
msgid "Right-click anywhere in the page editor to open the page submenu."
msgstr "ページ エディター内の任意の場所を右クリックして、ページのサブメニューを開きます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:40
msgid "![1742262402981](image/getting_started/1742262402981.png)"
msgstr "![1742262402981](image/getting_started/1742262402981.png)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:40
msgid "1742262402981"
msgstr "1742262402981"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:44
msgid "Paste copied keys to current page"
msgstr "コピーしたキーを現在のページに貼り付けます"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:45
msgid "Clear auto-remembered styles"
msgstr "自動記憶されたスタイルをクリアする"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:46
msgid "Close virtual UI"
msgstr "仮想 UI を閉じる"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:47
msgid "Save current page as image (not applicable to some keys)"
msgstr "現在のページを画像として保存 (一部のキーには適用されません)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/page_editor.md:48
msgid "Save each key as a separate image (not applicable to some keys)"
msgstr "各キーを個別の画像として保存（一部のキーでは利用できません）"
